{"seq":2,"slug":"admission-control-kyverno","title":"准入控制与 Kyverno","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/container-security/orchestration/admission-control-kyverno","wordCount":956,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"准入控制与-kyverno\">准入控制与 Kyverno</h1><p>Pod Security Standards 提供了&quot;三选一&quot;的粗粒度安全等级，但生产环境的策略需求远比这复杂：只允许从批准的注册表拉取镜像、禁止使用 <code>latest</code> tag、强制声明资源限制、验证镜像的 Cosign 签名、为每个 namespace 自动创建 default-deny NetworkPolicy。Kubernetes Admission Controllers 是实现这些需求的机制——它们拦截发往 API Server 的请求，在资源被持久化到 etcd 之前进行验证或修改。Kyverno 作为 CNCF 项目，以纯 YAML 的策略语言让 Kubernetes 团队无需学习 Rego 即可编写复杂的准入策略。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>准入控制在 Kubernetes API 请求生命周期中的位置：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[kubectl/API 请求] --&gt; B[认证 AuthN]&#10;    B --&gt; C[授权 AuthZ/RBAC]&#10;    C --&gt; D[Mutating Webhooks]&#10;    D --&gt; E[Schema 验证]&#10;    E --&gt; F[Validating Webhooks]&#10;    F --&gt; G{全部通过?}&#10;    G --&gt;|是| H[持久化到 etcd]&#10;    G --&gt;|否| I[返回拒绝响应]&#10;&#10;    D --- D1[Kyverno mutate]&#10;    D --- D2[注入安全默认值]&#10;    F --- F1[Kyverno validate]&#10;    F --- F2[OPA Gatekeeper]&#10;    F --- F3[强制安全策略]\">graph LR\n    A[kubectl/API 请求] --&gt; B[认证 AuthN]\n    B --&gt; C[授权 AuthZ/RBAC]\n    C --&gt; D[Mutating Webhooks]\n    D --&gt; E[Schema 验证]\n    E --&gt; F[Validating Webhooks]\n    F --&gt; G{全部通过?}\n    G --&gt;|是| H[持久化到 etcd]\n    G --&gt;|否| I[返回拒绝响应]\n\n    D --- D1[Kyverno mutate]\n    D --- D2[注入安全默认值]\n    F --- F1[Kyverno validate]\n    F --- F2[OPA Gatekeeper]\n    F --- F3[强制安全策略]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>Kyverno</th>\n<th>OPA Gatekeeper</th>\n<th>选型建议</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>策略语言</td>\n<td>YAML（Kubernetes 原生风格）</td>\n<td>Rego（专用策略语言）</td>\n<td>YAML 团队用 Kyverno</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>验证（validate）</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>两者都成熟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>修改（mutate）</td>\n<td>支持（自动注入默认值）</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>需 mutate 选 Kyverno</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生成（generate）</td>\n<td>支持（自动创建资源）</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>需 generate 选 Kyverno</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>镜像签名验证</td>\n<td>内置 verifyImages</td>\n<td>需外部数据提供者</td>\n<td>Kyverno 更便捷</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>学习曲线</td>\n<td>低（YAML 即策略）</td>\n<td>中高（Rego 独立语言）</td>\n<td>Kyverno 上手更快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>社区规模</td>\n<td>快速增长，CNCF Incubating</td>\n<td>成熟，CNCF Graduated</td>\n<td>Gatekeeper 更成熟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资源开销</td>\n<td>约 200MB/副本（建议 3 副本）</td>\n<td>约 150MB/副本（建议 3 副本）</td>\n<td>相当</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"kyverno-策略模型\">Kyverno 策略模型</h2><p>Kyverno 策略由规则（rules）组成，每条规则指定匹配条件和动作类型：</p>\n<p><strong>Validate 策略</strong>（验证 + 拒绝）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: kyverno.io/v1&#10;kind: ClusterPolicy&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: require-approved-registry&#10;  annotations:&#10;    policies.kyverno.io/title: 强制使用批准的镜像仓库&#10;    policies.kyverno.io/severity: high&#10;spec:&#10;  validationFailureAction: Enforce&#10;  rules:&#10;    - name: validate-registry&#10;      match:&#10;        any:&#10;          - resources:&#10;              kinds: [&#39;Pod&#39;]&#10;      validate:&#10;        message: &#39;镜像必须来自批准的注册表: ghcr.io/myorg/ 或 myregistry.io/&#39;&#10;        pattern:&#10;          spec:&#10;            containers:&#10;              - image: &#39;ghcr.io/myorg/* | myregistry.io/*&#39;&#10;            initContainers:&#10;              - image: &#39;ghcr.io/myorg/* | myregistry.io/*&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">kyverno.io/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ClusterPolicy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">require-approved-registry</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  annotations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    policies.kyverno.io/title</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">强制使用批准的镜像仓库</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    policies.kyverno.io/severity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">high</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  validationFailureAction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Enforce</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  rules</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">validate-registry</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      match</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">resources</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              kinds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Pod'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      validate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        message</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'镜像必须来自批准的注册表: ghcr.io/myorg/ 或 myregistry.io/'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        pattern</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            containers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">              - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ghcr.io/myorg/* | myregistry.io/*'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            initContainers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">              - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ghcr.io/myorg/* | myregistry.io/*'</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Mutate 策略</strong>（自动注入安全默认值）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: kyverno.io/v1&#10;kind: ClusterPolicy&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: inject-security-defaults&#10;spec:&#10;  rules:&#10;    - name: add-security-context&#10;      match:&#10;        any:&#10;          - resources:&#10;              kinds: [&#39;Pod&#39;]&#10;              namespaces: [&#39;!kube-system&#39;, &#39;!kyverno&#39;]&#10;      mutate:&#10;        patchStrategicMerge:&#10;          spec:&#10;            containers:&#10;              - (name): &#39;*&#39;&#10;                securityContext:&#10;                  +(runAsNonRoot): true&#10;                  +(readOnlyRootFilesystem): true&#10;                  +(allowPrivilegeEscalation): false\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">kyverno.io/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ClusterPolicy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">inject-security-defaults</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  rules</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">add-security-context</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      match</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">resources</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              kinds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Pod'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              namespaces</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'!kube-system'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'!kyverno'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      mutate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        patchStrategicMerge</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            containers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">              - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">(name)</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'*'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                securityContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                  +(runAsNonRoot)</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                  +(readOnlyRootFilesystem)</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                  +(allowPrivilegeEscalation)</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Generate 策略</strong>（自动创建关联资源）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: kyverno.io/v1&#10;kind: ClusterPolicy&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: generate-default-deny-networkpolicy&#10;spec:&#10;  rules:&#10;    - name: default-deny&#10;      match:&#10;        any:&#10;          - resources:&#10;              kinds: [&#39;Namespace&#39;]&#10;      generate:&#10;        apiVersion: networking.k8s.io/v1&#10;        kind: NetworkPolicy&#10;        name: default-deny-all&#10;        namespace: &#39;{{request.object.metadata.name}}&#39;&#10;        data:&#10;          spec:&#10;            podSelector: {}&#10;            policyTypes: [&#39;Ingress&#39;, &#39;Egress&#39;]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">kyverno.io/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ClusterPolicy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">generate-default-deny-networkpolicy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  rules</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">default-deny</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      match</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">resources</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              kinds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Namespace'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      generate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">networking.k8s.io/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">NetworkPolicy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">default-deny-all</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        namespace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'{{request.object.metadata.name}}'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            podSelector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            policyTypes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Ingress'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Egress'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"镜像签名验证\">镜像签名验证</h2><p>Kyverno 内置的 <code>verifyImages</code> 规则可以在 Pod 创建时验证镜像的 Cosign 签名，形成供应链安全的最后闭环：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: kyverno.io/v1&#10;kind: ClusterPolicy&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: verify-image-signatures&#10;spec:&#10;  validationFailureAction: Enforce&#10;  rules:&#10;    - name: verify-cosign-signature&#10;      match:&#10;        any:&#10;          - resources:&#10;              kinds: [&#39;Pod&#39;]&#10;      verifyImages:&#10;        - imageReferences: [&#39;ghcr.io/myorg/*&#39;]&#10;          attestors:&#10;            - entries:&#10;                - keyless:&#10;                    subject: &#39;https://github.com/myorg/*/blob/main/.github/workflows/*&#39;&#10;                    issuer: &#39;https://token.actions.githubusercontent.com&#39;&#10;                    rekor:&#10;                      url: &#39;https://rekor.sigstore.dev&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">kyverno.io/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ClusterPolicy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">verify-image-signatures</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  validationFailureAction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Enforce</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  rules</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">verify-cosign-signature</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      match</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">resources</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              kinds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Pod'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      verifyImages</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">imageReferences</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ghcr.io/myorg/*'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          attestors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">entries</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">keyless</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                    subject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'https://github.com/myorg/*/blob/main/.github/workflows/*'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                    issuer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'https://token.actions.githubusercontent.com'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                    rekor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                      url</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'https://rekor.sigstore.dev'</span></span></code></pre></div><p>当未签名或签名无效的镜像被部署时，Kyverno 直接返回拒绝响应，附带清晰的错误消息说明哪个镜像验证失败。</p>\n<h2 id=\"策略即代码工作流\">策略即代码工作流</h2><p>将安全策略视为代码进行管理：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>策略存储在 Git 仓库</strong>中，与基础设施代码同库或独立仓库</li>\n<li><strong>PR 评审</strong>：策略变更经过团队评审，确保不会意外阻断合法工作负载</li>\n<li><strong>CI 验证</strong>：使用 <code>kyverno apply --dry-run</code> 在 CI 中验证策略语法和逻辑</li>\n<li><strong>GitOps 部署</strong>：通过 ArgoCD/Flux 自动将策略同步到集群</li>\n<li><strong>审计模式先行</strong>：新策略先以 <code>Audit</code> 模式部署一周，收集违规数据</li>\n<li><strong>渐进 enforce</strong>：确认无误报后切换为 <code>Enforce</code></li>\n</ol>\n<p>Kyverno CLI 支持离线测试：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 在本地验证策略是否按预期工作&#10;kyverno apply ./policies/ --resource ./test-resources/ --detailed-results\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 在本地验证策略是否按预期工作</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kyverno</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> apply</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ./policies/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --resource</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ./test-resources/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --detailed-results</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"故障安全设计\">故障安全设计</h2><p>准入控制器的可用性直接影响集群的可用性——如果 webhook 不可达，API 请求会被阻塞或失败：</p>\n<p><strong>failurePolicy 选择</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>Fail</code>（推荐）：webhook 不可用时拒绝所有请求，防止不安全的工作负载在安全控制失效时被创建</li>\n<li><code>Ignore</code>：webhook 不可用时放行所有请求，保证可用性但牺牲安全性</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>高可用部署</strong>：Kyverno 至少部署 3 个副本，分布在不同节点；配置 PodDisruptionBudget 确保升级时始终有足够副本处理请求。</p>\n<p><strong>namespace 排除</strong>：系统 namespace（kube-system、kyverno 自身）应通过 webhook 的 <code>namespaceSelector</code> 排除，避免鸡生蛋问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>准入控制是部署时安全的最后一道门，将安全策略编码为基础设施约束</li>\n<li>Kyverno 以 YAML 原生策略、validate + mutate + generate 三合一能力脱颖而出</li>\n<li>镜像签名验证通过 <code>verifyImages</code> 形成供应链安全的部署时闭环</li>\n<li>策略即代码工作流（Git + CI + GitOps + 渐进 enforce）确保策略变更安全可控</li>\n<li>高可用部署和正确的 failurePolicy 配置是生产环境的必备考量</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"pod-security-standards\">Pod Security Standards</a>——Kyverno 策略所补充的内置安全基线</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../../../cybersecurity-applied/software-supply-chain-security/secure-build-and-policy/policy-as-code-and-admission\">策略即代码与准入控制</a>——从更广泛的安全治理视角理解准入控制</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"准入控制与 Kyverno","id":"准入控制与-kyverno"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Kyverno 策略模型","id":"kyverno-策略模型"},{"level":2,"text":"镜像签名验证","id":"镜像签名验证"},{"level":2,"text":"策略即代码工作流","id":"策略即代码工作流"},{"level":2,"text":"故障安全设计","id":"故障安全设计"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"Pod Security Standards 安全基线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/container-security/orchestration/pod-security-standards"},"next":{"title":"NetworkPolicy 微隔离","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/container-security/orchestration/network-policies"}}